---
title: Parent Information Meeting
date: 2025-12-05
excerpt: All parents of IB programme students are invited to an information meeting on 12 December 2025 in the school auditorium.
author: School Administration
---

All parents and guardians of students in the IB programme are warmly invited to an **information meeting on 12 December 2025 at 17:00** in the school auditorium.

## On the agenda

- An overview of progress in the current academic year, presented by the IB Coordinator.
- Key dates for the **May 2026 examination session**, including the internal-assessment deadlines.
- Guidance on supporting students through the Extended Essay and CAS commitments.
- An open question-and-answer session with subject teachers.

Light refreshments will be served afterwards, giving families a chance to speak with teachers individually.

If you are unable to attend, please contact the school office and we will share the meeting materials with you directly.
